    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d162">

                <pb facs="0247" n="139" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg139"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, (Received) <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-13"><hi rendition="#italic">March 13,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson reports that the terms proposed by Da Gama have been declined by the
                    Government, and that the city is practically deserted. The insurgents have not
                    returned the fire of the loyal forts which commenced at noon. The firing from
                    the batteries in the city will begin at 3.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
